{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/faq/layout,_N_T_/faq/page,_N_T_/faq"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/faq/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}},"routeCache":{"key":"/route-cache/APP_PAGE/b5576171f5a4de964641656c739d9b311930e12763f3f0bb0492a1abf0416ba1/$/faq","owner":{"kind":"APP_PAGE","sourceRoute":"/faq/page"},"isFallback":false}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/4a94dd0c659d2f0e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-2b4d7c5d580743fd.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c7408084347438ae.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/794-7f73adcbcf7f7d3f.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-4d4dbaca24f0d56d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/500-fc3b64d9ff4a32a7.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/faq/page-02a382dc0186834c.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#361a4a\"/><title>Moremi Community Foundation</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"A youth development and opportunity network, starting in Lagos.\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-paper\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:absolute focus:p-4 focus:bg-white focus:z-50\">Skip to content</a><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-stone-200/80 bg-paper/80 backdrop-blur-xl\"><nav aria-label=\"Main\" class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 sm:px-8 sm:py-4\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:no-underline\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 sm:h-10 sm:w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-plum text-gold font-serif text-xl font-bold shadow-md\">M</div><div class=\"leading-none\"><span class=\"block font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-plum\">Moremi</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 block font-sans text-[0.55rem] sm:text-[0.6rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-plum/60\">Foundation</span></div></a><div class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-bold\"><a class=\"hover:text-plum text-stone-500 hover:no-underline transition-colors\" href=\"/program/\">M90</a><a class=\"hover:text-plum text-stone-500 hover:no-underline transition-colors\" href=\"/faq/\">FAQs</a><a class=\"rounded-full bg-plum/5 px-4 py-2 text-plum hover:bg-plum/10 hover:no-underline transition-colors border border-plum/10 shadow-sm sm:px-5 sm:py-2.5\" href=\"/activate/\">Log In</a></div></nav></header><main id=\"main\" class=\"flex-1\"><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-5\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Applicant guide</p><h1>Common questions</h1><details class=\"panel\"><summary class=\"font-semibold\">Who can apply?</summary><p>The founding intake is for young people aged 18–35 at the cohort start. The pilot begins in Lagos.</p></details><details class=\"panel\"><summary class=\"font-semibold\">What does membership cost?</summary><p>Membership is free. The programme team selects participants through an application review.</p></details><details class=\"panel\"><summary class=\"font-semibold\">Does MCF offer seed funding or jobs?</summary><p>M90 offers mentors, learning sessions and opportunities to contribute. A place does not guarantee funding or employment.</p></details><details class=\"panel\"><summary class=\"font-semibold\">How much time should I set aside?</summary><p>Plan to take part across the full 90 days. Tell us your availability so the team can discuss session commitments before activation.</p></details><details class=\"panel\"><summary class=\"font-semibold\">How do I enter the member portal?</summary><p>Selected applicants receive a private invitation. Enter the token and verify the code sent to the email on your application.</p></details><details class=\"panel\"><summary class=\"font-semibold\">What works offline?</summary><p>Members can save selected PDF worksheets on a personal device. Chat, meetings and submissions require a connection.</p></details><a class=\"button\" href=\"/program/\">Explore the programme</a></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-auto border-t border-stone-200 bg-white py-12 text-center text-sm font-medium text-stone-500\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-plum/5 text-plum font-serif font-bold mb-4\">M</div><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Moremi Community Foundation.</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-stone-400\">Built for the Lagos Founding Cohort.</p></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-2b4d7c5d580743fd.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:\\\"static/chunks/500-fc3b64d9ff4a32a7.js\\\"\\n3:\\\"static/chunks/app/faq/page-02a382dc0186834c.js\\\"\\n4:I[8500,[\\\"500\\\",\\\"$2\\\",\\\"505\\\",\\\"$3\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[7121,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[4581,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n13:\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"\\n14:I[484,[],\\\"$13\\\"]\\n16:\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"\\n17:I[484,[],\\\"$16\\\"]\\n18:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\n1a:I[7123,[],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/4a94dd0c659d2f0e.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n8:X\\n9:[[\\\"children\\\",{\\\"s\\\":\\\"__PAGE__\\\",\\\"h\\\":512,\\\"d\\\":{\\\"r\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\